      "claim": "L5 same-scaffold analogs M01 and M16 share the query acrylamide-piperidine-pyrazolopyrimidine core and show no appreciable gut-wall efflux with Caco-2 efflux ratios of 1.03 and 0.66 and high A-to-B permeability, indicating gut-wall efflux is unlikely to limit absorption.",
