      "claim": "L6 records show the same scaffold class including acalabrutinib and zanubrutinib is primarily cleared by hepatic CYP3A metabolism, yet these are clinically used oral drugs, so CYP3A first-pass metabolism alone does not establish F below 20 percent.",
